---
// Order state machine for the walk-through in the post: Pending new → New → Partially filled
// → Filled, plus the reject and cancel branches. Box codes are OrdStatus (tag 39) values;
// arrow codes are ExecType (tag 150) values as the post uses them (FIX 4.2 style).
// Inline SVG, site tokens, polygon arrowheads (no ids).

const W = 900;
const H = 440;
const bw = 128;
const bh = 60;
const row1 = 72;
const row2 = 252;

type State = { x: number; y: number; en: string; vi: string; code: string; final?: boolean };
const S: Record<string, State> = {
  pn: { x: 20, y: row1, en: 'Pending new', vi: 'Chờ sàn nhận', code: 'OrdStatus=A' },
  nw: { x: 264, y: row1, en: 'New', vi: 'New (đã lên sổ)', code: 'OrdStatus=0' },
  pf: { x: 508, y: row1, en: 'Partially filled', vi: 'Khớp một phần', code: 'OrdStatus=1' },
  fi: { x: 752, y: row1, en: 'Filled', vi: 'Khớp hết', code: 'OrdStatus=2', final: true },
  rj: { x: 20, y: row2, en: 'Rejected', vi: 'Bị từ chối', code: 'OrdStatus=8', final: true },
  pc: { x: 386, y: row2, en: 'Pending cancel', vi: 'Chờ hủy', code: 'OrdStatus=6' },
  cx: { x: 630, y: row2, en: 'Canceled', vi: 'Đã hủy', code: 'OrdStatus=4', final: true },
};

function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const len = 9;
  const p1 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${(x2 - 7 * Math.cos(a)).toFixed(1)} ${(y2 - 7 * Math.sin(a)).toFixed(1)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}

const midY1 = row1 + bh / 2;
const midY2 = row2 + bh / 2;
// Horizontal transitions with a word label above and the ExecType below.
const hops = [
  { a: arrow(S.pn.x + bw, midY1, S.nw.x, midY1), x: (S.pn.x + bw + S.nw.x) / 2, y: midY1, en: 'venue accepts', vi: 'sàn nhận lệnh', code: 'ExecType=0' },
  { a: arrow(S.nw.x + bw, midY1, S.pf.x, midY1), x: (S.nw.x + bw + S.pf.x) / 2, y: midY1, en: '400 match', vi: 'khớp 400', code: 'ExecType=1' },
  { a: arrow(S.pf.x + bw, midY1, S.fi.x, midY1), x: (S.pf.x + bw + S.fi.x) / 2, y: midY1, en: 'last 600 match', vi: 'khớp nốt 600', code: 'ExecType=2' },
  { a: arrow(S.pc.x + bw, midY2, S.cx.x, midY2), x: (S.pc.x + bw + S.cx.x) / 2, y: midY2, en: 'venue cancels', vi: 'sàn hủy lệnh', code: 'ExecType=4' },
];

const entry = arrow(S.pn.x + bw / 2, 30, S.pn.x + bw / 2, row1);
const toReject = arrow(S.pn.x + bw / 2, row1 + bh, S.pn.x + bw / 2, row2);
const cancelFromNew = arrow(348, row1 + bh, 420, row2);
const cancelFromPartial = arrow(552, row1 + bh, 480, row2);
const pcMid = S.pc.x + bw / 2;
---
<figure class="fixorder">
  <div class="fixorder-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Order states. The client sends 35=D and the order is pending new. The venue accepts it (New), 400 shares match (Partially filled), the last 600 match (Filled, final). The venue can instead reject the order (Rejected, final). From New or Partially filled a 35=F cancel request moves it to Pending cancel, then the venue cancels it (Canceled, final); if it filled first the venue answers 35=9 OrderCancelReject, too late to cancel.">
      {/* entry */}
      <text x={S.pn.x + bw / 2 + 12} y="24" class="fixorder-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>client sends 35=D</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>client gửi 35=D</tspan>
      </text>
      <g class="fixorder-arrow is-client"><path d={entry.line} /><polygon points={entry.head} /></g>

      {/* transitions */}
      {hops.map((h) => (
        <g>
          <g class="fixorder-arrow"><path d={h.a.line} /><polygon points={h.a.head} /></g>
          <text x={h.x} y={h.y - 9} text-anchor="middle" class="fixorder-lbl">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{h.en}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{h.vi}</tspan>
          </text>
          <text x={h.x} y={h.y + 20} text-anchor="middle" class="fixorder-code">{h.code}</text>
        </g>
      ))}

      <g class="fixorder-arrow"><path d={toReject.line} /><polygon points={toReject.head} /></g>
      <text x={S.pn.x + bw / 2 + 12} y="182" class="fixorder-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>venue refuses</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>sàn từ chối</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={S.pn.x + bw / 2 + 12} y="201" class="fixorder-code">ExecType=8</text>

      <g class="fixorder-arrow is-client"><path d={cancelFromNew.line} /><polygon points={cancelFromNew.head} /></g>
      <g class="fixorder-arrow is-client"><path d={cancelFromPartial.line} /><polygon points={cancelFromPartial.head} /></g>
      <text x={pcMid} y="182" text-anchor="middle" class="fixorder-lbl">35=F</text>
      <text x={pcMid} y="201" text-anchor="middle" class="fixorder-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>cancel request</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>yêu cầu hủy</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* states */}
      {Object.values(S).map((s) => (
        <g class={s.final ? 'fixorder-state is-final' : 'fixorder-state'}>
          <rect x={s.x} y={s.y} width={bw} height={bh} rx="8" />
          <text x={s.x + bw / 2} y={s.y + 26} text-anchor="middle" class="fixorder-name">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{s.en}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{s.vi}</tspan>
          </text>
          <text x={s.x + bw / 2} y={s.y + 46} text-anchor="middle" class="fixorder-code">{s.code}</text>
        </g>
      ))}

      {/* too-late branch */}
      <text x={pcMid} y={row2 + bh + 28} text-anchor="middle" class="fixorder-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Filled before the cancel arrived?</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lệnh đã khớp hết trước khi tin hủy tới?</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={pcMid} y={row2 + bh + 48} text-anchor="middle" class="fixorder-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>The venue answers 35=9 OrderCancelReject: too late to cancel.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Sàn trả về 35=9 OrderCancelReject: quá trễ để hủy.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* legend */}
      <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="388" y2="388" class="fixorder-rule" />
      <rect x="20" y="403" width="22" height="14" rx="3" class="fixorder-key" />
      <text x="52" y="415" class="fixorder-legend">
        <tspan data-lang-en>final state: the order cannot change any more</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>trạng thái cuối: lệnh không đổi được nữa</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={W - 20} y="415" text-anchor="end" class="fixorder-legend">
        <tspan data-lang-en>every reply from the venue is a 35=8 ExecutionReport</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>mọi phản hồi của sàn là một ExecutionReport 35=8</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Box codes are OrdStatus (tag 39): where the order stands. Arrow codes are ExecType (tag 150): what just happened. ClOrdID (tag 11) belongs to the client; the venue adds OrderID (tag 37) and a new ExecID (tag 17) on each report. ExecType 1 and 2 follow FIX 4.2; FIX 4.4 reports every fill as ExecType=F (Trade).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mã trong ô là OrdStatus (tag 39): lệnh đang ở đâu. Mã trên mũi tên là ExecType (tag 150): việc gì vừa xảy ra. ClOrdID (tag 11) do client đặt; sàn thêm OrderID (tag 37) và một ExecID (tag 17) mới cho mỗi báo cáo. ExecType 1 và 2 theo FIX 4.2; từ FIX 4.4 mọi lần khớp đều báo bằng ExecType=F (Trade).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fixorder {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .fixorder-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .fixorder svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .fixorder text {
    font-size: 14px;
    fill: var(--text-body);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .fixorder-state rect {
    fill: var(--bg-alt);
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }
  .fixorder-state.is-final rect {
    fill: var(--red-tint-bg);
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-width: 1.8;
  }
  .fixorder .fixorder-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .fixorder .fixorder-code {
    font-size: 13px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .fixorder .fixorder-lbl {
    font-size: 13.5px;
  }
  .fixorder .fixorder-note {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .fixorder-arrow path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .fixorder-arrow polygon {
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .fixorder-arrow.is-client path {
    stroke-dasharray: 5 4;
  }
  .fixorder-rule {
    stroke: var(--border);
  }
  .fixorder-key {
    fill: var(--red-tint-bg);
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-width: 1.8;
  }
  .fixorder .fixorder-legend {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .fixorder figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
